title: CICD Infra
Infra [icon: aws-infrastructure-composer]{
  CICD [icon: gitlab]{
    DEV [icon: user]
    gitlab-cicd [icon: gitlab] {
      Build Artifact [icon: aws-codebuild]
      Artifact S3 [icon: aws-s3]
    }
    CodeDeploy [icon: aws-codedeploy] {
      Prepare Revision [icon: file-archive]          // Pull artifact from S3
      Create Green [icon: aws-auto-scaling-group]
      ApplicationStart [icon: play]
      ValidateService [icon: check]
      }
    Compute [icon: aws-compute]{
      AutoScalingGroup [icon: aws-auto-scaling-group]
      Blue V1 [icon: aws-ec2]
      Green V2 [icon: aws-ec2]
    }
  IAM Policies [icon: aws-iam]
  }
  ALB [icon: aws-application-load-balancer] 
  Users [icon: users]
  QA Team [icon: person]
}

DEV > Build Artifact > Artifact S3 > Prepare Revision > Create Green > ApplicationStart > ValidateService > AutoScalingGroup
AutoScalingGroup >  Green V2
CodeDeploy < IAM Policies
gitlab-cicd < IAM Policies
Blue V1 < ALB : OLD Version : [color: blue, colorMode: outline]
ALB < Users : [color: blue, colorMode: outline]
